    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποληπ-τέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολαμβάνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				suppose, understand, regard,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἆλλα . . τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					156e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕτως ὑ. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					613a
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				648a14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνα . . ἔχον δύναμιν αὐτὸ ὑ.;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					49a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
